JSON type handling.\r\n\r\nData:\r\n\r\n```\r\n{\r\n\t\"key1\": 42,\r\n\t\"key2\": 3.14,\r\n\t\"key3\": 100,\r\n\t\"key4\": 541.,\r\n\t\"key5\": 0.0,\r\n\t\"key6\": 0102\r\n}\r\n\r\n```\r\n\r\nExample GDScript:\r\n\r\n```\r\nfunc _ready() -> void:\r\n\tvar data = FileAccess.get_file_as_string(\"res://data.json\")\r\n\r\n\tvar json_data = JSON.parse_string(data)\r\n\tprint(json_data[\"key1\"])\r\n\tprint(json_data[\"key2\"])\r\n\tprint(json_data[\"key3\"])\r\n\tprint(json_data[\"key4\"])\r\n\tprint(json_data[\"key5\"])\r\n\tprint(json_data[\"key6\"])\r\n\r\n```\r\n\r\n```\r\nCurrent:\r\n42.0\r\n3.14\r\n100.0\r\n541.0\r\n0.0\r\n102.0\r\n```\r\n```\r\nPatch:\r\n42\r\n3.14\r\n100\r\n541.0\r\n0.0\r\n102\r\n```","labels":[{"id":73330068,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2OA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/feature%20proposal","name":"feature proposal","description":"","color":"4466ff","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279096997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTY5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/archived","name":"archived","description":"","color":"aaaaaa","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279097966,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTc5NjY=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:core","name":"topic:core","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":955079684,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw5NTUwNzk2ODQ=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/breaks%20compat","name":"breaks compat","description":"","color":"b64245","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2024-12-15T22:48:39Z","updated_at":"2025-02-04T08:39:47Z","closed_at":"2025-02-03T21:12:55Z","merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":"9099a76b189a80dc567f8282f22f4e96c648219c","assignee":null,"assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"head":{"l